Package: openmediavault-imagecheck
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8),
         python3,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: docker-ce | docker.io
Description: Docker image update checker
 Monitor-only checker that reports whether newer Docker images are available
 for running containers.
 .
 For every running container the local registry digest (what was actually
 pulled) is compared against the digest the registry currently advertises for
 that same tag, fetched without pulling the image. It never pulls, recreates
 or changes anything - it only reports.
 .
 The result is cached daily by a cron job and exposed through the ImageCheck
 RPC service, a workbench page and a dashboard widget.
